  "representativeCastDefIDOverride": "castDef_MizukiBekker",
  "shortDescription": "Beneath the worn ruins of <i>Rim Worlds Republic Outpost #11</i>, Tribe engineers have uncovered a buried SLDF research site. Among the wreckage are fragments of a long-lost training simulator program and advanced testing equipment, remnants of an experimental combat doctrine initiative.\n\nGhost Bear Watch scouts have already detected activity near the site and are closing in. If recovered, these relics could provide valuable insight into Star League-era tactical thinking and even bolster the Tribe's current training protocols.\n\nYour mission is to reach the site, secure and extract the surviving artifacts, and ensure the enemy cannot destroy or seize them. Expect opposition and potential reinforcement waves once the operation begins.",
  "longDescription": "Training tech from the SLDF era buried out here? That's some serious gold to the right hands. Just hope we're not digging while the Bears are already firing.",
